    "biography": "<p><strong>Morph:</strong> Olympian</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Beam Weapons 45, Clubs 45, Fray 55, Intimidation 60, Kinesics 40, Kinetic Weapons 50, Networking: Criminal 60, Palming 50, Perception 45, Profession: Police Procedures 30, Protocol 55, Unarmed Combat 50</p><p><strong>Rep:</strong> g-rep 25</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Pain Tolerance (Level 1)</p><p><strong>Implants:</strong> Basic Biomods, Basic Mesh Inserts, Bioweave Armor (Heavy), Cortical Stack, Enhanced Hearing, Skin Pocket</p><p><strong>Armor:</strong> 3/4 (Armored Clothing)</p><p><strong>melee:</strong> Extendable Baton 45 (DV 1d10 + 4)</p><p><strong>ranged:</strong> Agonizer 50 (Pain or AP –5, DV 2d10, Ammo 50)</p><p><strong>ranged:</strong> Medium Pistol 50 with hollow point ammo (DV 3d10 + 2, Mode SA/BF/FA, Ammo 12)</p><p><em>Printed: INIT 80, SPD 1, LUC 30, TT 6, IR 60, DUR 40, WT 8, DR 60.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Ego Hunter, p. 13.</em></p>",
